If it's the very same quirk, you don't have to invent a new name, but
just add a line:
	SND_PCI_QUIRK(0x1028, 0x0688, "Alienware 17 2015", QUIRK_ALIENWARE),

So it'd be a oneliner.  Could you respin and resubmit the patch?


thanks,

